# Demo SDA key profile shared by perso/emv/sample.perso and perso/emv/sample-test.perso
# (EMV v4.4 Book 2 §5).
#
# Two RSA-1024 key pairs with e = 65537: a demo Certification Authority that
# signs the Issuer Public Key Certificate, and a demo Issuer that signs the SSAD
# and the ICC public key certificates.  These keys are printed on purpose and
# MUST NEVER be used on a real card; a real deployment keeps its own profile
# outside the repository and passes it with `perso-export -keys=<path>`.
#
# Format: `key = hex`, `#` comments and blank lines ignored (see
# card42.host.perso.SdaKeyProfile).

